ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi133: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET containing EDGE_LOOP with 2 adjacent B-spline edges; shared vertex at (5,0,0) — geometrically valid meeting point; e1: B_SPLINE_CURVE_WITH_KNOTS degree-3 (0,0,0)→(5,0,0) many interior knots; e2: B_SPLINE_CURVE_WITH_KNOTS degree-3 (5,0,0)→(10,0,0) many interior knots; CheckCurveGap uses parameter-sampling to evaluate endpoint positions; floating-point accumulation across knot evaluations causes false gap IS defect; endpoints are geometrically coincident but sampler reports sub-tolerance discrepancy; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty; all EDGE_CURVEs ARE wired into EDGE_LOOP; never orphaned */
